# set_order UP/DOWN with mixed filter kinds: a filter only swaps with the nearest neighbour whose ASYNC flag equals
# its own; TOP/BOTTOM ignore kinds.  Array (newest first) is built as: v3 a2 v2 a1 v1 (v = video filter, a = async).
kind in input asyncvideo,audio
kind va filter asyncvideo
kind vb filter video
create s in S
create v1 vb V1
create a1 va A1
create v2 vb V2
create a2 va A2
create v3 vb V3
filter_add s v1
filter_add s a1
filter_add s v2
filter_add s a2
filter_add s v3
names s
filter_order s v3 up
names s
filter_order s v3 up
names s
filter_order s v1 down
names s
filter_order s a1 up
names s
filter_order s a1 down
names s
filter_order s a2 up
names s
filter_order s v2 bottom
names s
filter_order s a2 top
names s
